{"id": "t087-054", "text": "rana's dad passed away sunday night, v sudden, heart attack at home. funeral thurs 11am at the mosque on brick lane then back to their house. karim says she's in pieces and hasnt slept, her mum's not coping either. karim's taking the rest of the wk off. send card tmrw and ask karim if she needs anything, maybe drop food round fri", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "rana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sunday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "thurs 11am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "karim", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in pieces", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not coping", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "karim", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the rest of the wk"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "tmrw", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask karim if she needs anything", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "karim", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop food round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "fri", "anchor": "a3"}]}
