{"id": "t087-059", "text": "henrik's dad home now, finally. he's going up every other weekend to help out w/ shopping and appts, and his sister Olga lives 10 mins away so she does the weekdays. she's apparently exhausted and they're talking about getting a carer in a couple of mornings a wk. henrik seems a bit lighter about it all now tho. should take him for lunch thurs", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every other weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olga", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives 10 mins away", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekdays"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a couple of mornings a wk"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit lighter", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for lunch", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "thurs", "anchor": "a1"}]}
